+  Magazine Pro', sign-off says 'Bitcoin Magazine' -> heard (fuzzy 0.89 >= 0.85 against 'bitcoinmagazinefor').
+  Same for Coffeezilla / Coffeezilla Extras and CNBC / CNBC Television. (Real Vision Finance credited, 'Real Vision'
